17:59.710 --> 18:00.130
Oh, trying to weird him out, now?

18:00.130 --> 18:01.290
Oh, trying to weird him out, now?
The key is to tune your brain waves<b></b>

18:01.290 --> 18:02.290
Oh, trying to weird him out, now?
to the electromagnetic waves-<b></b>

18:02.920 --> 18:06.000
Can you read what’s on my mind right now, then?

18:06.330 --> 18:07.580
This guy’s determined!

18:11.210 --> 18:12.670
You want some ice cream!

18:12.670 --> 18:13.580
More like YOU do!

18:13.960 --> 18:15.000
Nope!

18:15.380 --> 18:19.170
I was actually thinking how
much cuter you look up close!

18:19.170 --> 18:23.130
What a creep! She’s not into you, dude.

18:23.130 --> 18:26.000
You’re pretty funny, you know that?

18:26.330 --> 18:28.290
I am?! How so?!

18:29.460 --> 18:32.420
THAT’S what she was waiting for?

18:32.420 --> 18:34.250
That whole, “I don’t know what LINE is” bit.

18:35.920 --> 18:39.250
I’ve used that one so many times,
I’ve got it down to a science!

18:40.750 --> 18:42.670
I really don’t know what it is, though!

18:44.130 --> 18:46.790
You really are funny.

18:46.790 --> 18:48.290
Oh, come on.

18:50.670 --> 18:52.880
Quit looking like you enjoy it...

18:58.250 --> 18:58.880
Hey.

19:01.580 --> 19:04.210
Really though, add me on LINE.

19:04.630 --> 19:06.210
No, I-

19:09.790 --> 19:11.080
Seriously, though.

19:13.210 --> 19:13.920
I-

19:20.920 --> 19:21.920
Fine...

19:30.290 --> 19:31.830
Not like it matters.

19:35.420 --> 19:36.920
Who cares?

19:42.630 --> 19:44.500
I don’t, right?

19:46.710 --> 19:50.380
Am I really messed up in the head?

20:16.250 --> 20:18.210
Yamada!

20:19.790 --> 20:21.540
Chii, did you see that?

20:21.540 --> 20:24.250
Ichikawa just sent his bike flying.

20:26.750 --> 20:28.290
She saw that?

20:32.460 --> 20:33.920
What did you do that for?

20:34.420 --> 20:36.250
No, I uhh...

20:37.580 --> 20:38.790
Well...

20:42.790 --> 20:45.670
I hit the gas instead of the brakes.

21:02.580 --> 21:05.380
You’re pretty funny, Ichikawa.

21:22.670 --> 21:24.880
<b>I Was</b>

21:24.880 --> 21:30.880
<b>I Was Stolen Away</b>
